🎀 A Little World Just for You

A cute and interactive website created to bring happiness and put a smile on someone’s face.

A little digital adventure filled with games, surprises, and sweet moments. 💗

✨ Features

• Cute pastel-themed design.
• Interactive welcome page.
• Memory Match game.
• Heart Catcher mini-game.
• Mystery gift selection.
• Special winner celebration page.
• Play again option.
• Responsive design.

🎮 Games & Activities

1. Memory Match: Find matching pairs of cards.
2. Heart Catcher: Catch as many hearts as possible in 20 seconds.
3. Mystery Gifts: Choose your favorite surprise gift.

💻 Technologies Used

• HTML
• CSS
• JavaScript

